@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy notice"; Layout = "_PublicLayout"; }
<div class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy notice (POPIA)</h1><p>How Ubuhlebethu Business Enterprise cc handles the information you send us.</p></div></div>
<div class="container prose">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit a proposal we collect your name, email address, phone number, company (optional), site location, a description of the project, an indicative budget (optional) and the business proposal document you upload.</p>
    <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
    <p>Only to assess your proposal, contact you about it, prepare an estimate and, if accepted, set up the project and invoice. We do not sell your information or use it for unrelated marketing.</p>
    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <p>Authorised Ubuhlebethu office staff, management and system administrators. Access is controlled by role and recorded in an audit log. Documents are stored in our secured database and downloaded only by authorised staff.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Rejected or abandoned proposals are kept for a limited period for record-keeping and then deleted. Accepted proposals are kept as part of the project and financial record.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may ask to see, correct or delete your information at any time. Contact the information officer at <a href="mailto:info@ubuhlebethu.co.za">info@ubuhlebethu.co.za</a> or on 011 887 7240, quoting your proposal reference.</p>
</div>
